  "description": "Best friend Charlotte's wedding day!! Stefan flew to Texas to attend Wedding party and enjoyment ended after meeting Land who Stefan never wanted to meet. Stefan and Land's ill-fated relationship started from 10 years ago, on their first meet. Stefan got crush on Land, with Land's beauty. But Land's first speech was \"Charlotte always talked about a homo and was it you?\". Since that Land became an enemy of Stefan! Stefan tried so hard not to meet him.... but, they bumped into each other in Charlotte's wedding... *(Source: KENAZ)*\n\n**Official Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5154986), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H035772491), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052921), Bookpal, Tocsoda, [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/6277), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/timing_19)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5147432), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116000053), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52349685), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/timing_15)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [English (Expired)](https://manta.net/series/1246), [Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/100077)\n\n***Note:**  \n-Based on the book with the same name of Mary Calmes.*",
